Rule 7 (precision reduction bounds for tensor operand based on its floating point type)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : int} |= (dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8) ∧ v_2 ≥ 1 ∧ v_3 ≥ 0 ∧ (if dtype_(v_1) = 6 then v_2 + v_3 < 16 else (if dtype_(v_1) = 7 then v_2 + v_3 < 32 else v_2 + v_3 < 64))
>>
